site.\nThe transactions available on brickz are recorded once the stamp duty for the transaction is paid and not when the SPA is signed. It will take few months for a transaction to be reflected on brickz. Therefore, the transaction data for the latest months are incomplete as there is a time-lag between the sale of a property and the subsequent registration of this information. The missing data is included as it becomes available. Our analytics are also based on the data available and may be subject to revision as and when more data becomes available.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nData Update - brickz (https://static.brickz.my/data-update/)\nciteturn262search7 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 5 days ago; The data on brickz for the respective location is based on sub-sale transactions with the stamp duty paid from the “Updated Since” month till the “Latest Update”  month ... KULAI  | Jul 2022  | Jul 2026 ... The source of data on Brickz records a property transaction once the stamp duty for the Sales and Purchase is paid.\n\n# Data Update\n\n##### Below is a table showing the data updates by state and districts. The incoming data varies by locations. So as and when the data is received, we will update our website and this page.\n\nThe data on brickz for the respective location is based on sub-sale transactions with the stamp duty paid from the “Updated Since” month till the “Latest Update”  month\n\n##### State/District\n\n | \n\n##### Updated Since\n\n | \n\n##### Latest Update\n\n--- | --- | ---\nJOHOR\n---\nBATU PAHAT  | Jan 2017  | Jul 2026\nJOHOR BAHRU  | Jan 2017  | Jul 2026\nKLUANG  | Jan 2017  | Jul 2026\nKOTA TINGGI  | Jan 2017  | Jul 2026\nKULAI  | Jul 2022  | Jul 2026\nKULAIJAYA  | Jan 2017  | Jun 2022\nMERSING  | Jan 2017  | Jul 2026\nMUAR  | Jan 2017  | Jul 2026\nPONTIAN  | Jan 2017  | Jul 2026\nSEGAMAT  | Jan 2017  | Jul 2026\nTANGKAK  | Jan 2017  | Jul 2026\nKEDAH\n---\nBALING  | Jan 2017  | Jul 2026\nBAN